load_theory — retained server obligations
==================================================

Status: retained contract; current carve-out verification pending.

Load a theory and its dependencies through Headless.Session.use_theories. Resolve session-qualified names through the session structure or use master_dir. Return per-theory status and positioned messages. Preserve cancellation and document-mutation serialization. No resource registration or source attachment follows loading.

Verification obligations
------------------------

T1 [bridge] A well-formed theory under master_dir loads successfully.

T2 [bridge] A broken theory reports an error with positioned messages.

T3 [bridge] Session-qualified names resolve without master_dir through the startup session structure.

T4 [bridge] Loading an unchanged theory succeeds.

T6 [e2e] Load a filesystem fixture, edit it, and check the edited file through the retained public tools.
